fessionals and world-class academics, to a great environment and reputation, we'll help you reach your goals and beyond. Job Search Are you an academic looking to be part of world-renowned research? Maybe you're a professional destined to take the next step. We have a range of opportunities to explore. Why work at Monash? We're ranked in the top 50 universities worldwide, but that's just a start. From the environment to the opportunities, there are so many reasons to build a career with us. How to apply Make sure you're ready when that dream role arises. We have everything to prepare you, from your first job search to your final interview. Inclusive workplace Our long-standing commitment to equality gives everyone the opportunity to succeed. Find out how much we value our community. Policies and procedures We reward our staff with excellent conditions and opportunities to develop new skills. Find everything you need for your journey with us. Monash Wellbeing Named as a Global Healthy Workplace Award winner, we're committed to creating a positive workplace for our community. We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Mona