    "https://www.monash.edu/jobs/jobs-at-monash": {
      "title": "Job search",
      "description": "Job search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search Job search Job search At Monash University, we embrace the best talent from inside and outside our walls. Whether you want to be part of world-renowned research or take the next step in your professional life, we have a range of opportunities to explore. Jobs at Monash Australia From a great environment and reputation, to exciting development opportunities, there are many reasons to join the Monash community. Jobs for Indigenous Australians Click here to find out more information about employment at Monash University for Indigenous Australians Jobs for Staff Already working at Monash University and looking to advance your career? We have a great range of internal roles. Jobs for Students Are you a current Monash student? Jump start your career with our Jobs for Students program. Get experience and build your employability while you study. Jobs at Monash Malaysia Whether seeking an academic or professional position, you will quickly see the benefits and opportunities of working at Monash University Malaysia within a dynamic community of scholars. Explore Monash Indonesia Monash Indonesia is recruiting a number of outstanding academic and professional positions across a range of areas and levels. Access your application Log in to complete an application or induction, or view your offer online. We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Lates