    "https://www.monash.edu/jobs/how-to-apply/tgd-applicants": {
      "title": "Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants",
      "description": "Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants You are here: Home | How to apply | Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Monash University recognises and values the diversity of its community, including transgender, gender diverse and non-binary people. We recognise that a person’s gender identity may shift or evolve over their lifespan and we support and welcome staff and students affirming their gender identity as part of a safe, respectful and inclusive workplace and learning environment. Monash also recognises that trans and gender diverse applicants face barriers in recruitment that can be challenging to overcome without organisational support. We have implemented strategies and actions to foster inclusion in the recruitment process in a variety of ways, including the following: Education All staff have access to LGBTIQA+ Ally Training, Transgender Awareness Training, and Rainbow Communities and LGBTIQA+ 101, which are widely promoted to staff Recruitment and hiring managers have access to LGBTIQA+ training specific to the hiring process Systems Our recruitment portal does not require applicants to provide information on their gender We provide options for selecting diverse pronouns in our systems, including the recruitment portal Diversity Monash actively expects diversity on decision making panels , which is part of ensuring our processes are free from the effects of unconscious bias Hiring managers are equipped with the information to support diverse populations through the recruitment process Leadership Our leaders value the diversity of the Monash community, with a diverse community at all levels of the organisation. This is one of the stated goals of the Monash Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Framework 2022-2030 Monash supports staff and students through our Gender Affirmation Procedure , which includes 30 days of paid leave to support staff Support Trans and gender diverse applicants are invited to contact Anthea Jensen , Senior Advisor, Staff Equity, Diversity and Inclusion at staff-equity@monash.edu or on + 61 (3) 9902 9915 for enquiries or support related to their application, recruitment and onboarding. We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Registered Australian University ABN: 12 377 614 012 TEQSA Provider ID: PRV12140 CRICOS Provider Number Monash University: 00008C Monash College: 01857J Authorised by Executive Director, Marketing Website feedback Last updated: Nov 2025 Accessibility Disclaimer & copyright Terms & conditions Data privacy & cyber security Data Consent Settings Copyright © 2026 Monash University We use cookies to improve your experience, but you can choose which ones we use, and opt-out at any time. You can find more information in our Website Terms and Conditions Accept  all Cookie settings"
