ntitlements Probation, performance and promotion Diversity and inclusion Leave and wellbeing A-Z Index A-Z Index Contact us Quality and Standards More Quality and Standards Apply to study Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search Search the Policy Bank https://www.monash.edu/search Search the Policy Bank See all other results HR Human Resources Policies and Procedures A comprehensive set of policies and procedures to support staff and managers in the workplace relating to employment at Monash. Further links relevant to HR policies and procedures can be found on the HR Policy Bank Resources Intranet Page (staff only) Employment conditions Find out the terms and conditions of employment and options to adapt to changes in your work or personal circumstances. Recruitment and appointment We employ and appoint staff through a range of fair, ethical and equitable processes. Staff Code of Conduct How we demonstrate our values and define expected standards of behaviours. Pay, benefits and entitlements A summary of competitive pay, benefits and entitlements. Probation, performance and promotion We encourage and support staff to perform to their highest standards and provide development and career opportunities. Diversity and inclusion Promoting and supporting equality, diversity and inclusion in the workplace. Leave and wellbeing Access a range of leave entitlements and wellbeing initiatives that support a work-life balance. A-Z Index A-Z listing of HR policies and procedures Enterprise agreements Our enterprise agreements cover the terms and conditions of your employment at Monash University. We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recru