    "https://careers.pageuppeople.com/513/cw/en/job/628245/indigenous-pool-for-professional-appointments-expression-of-interest": {
      "title": "Job Search",
      "description": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search You are here: Home | Job Search Job Search Applicant login Job alert Job Search e.g. Lecturer, Admin assistant Refine Search Categories Indigenous Indigenous 1 Professional Administration 1 Advancement 1 Buildings and Property 1 Business Development and Industry Engagement 1 Commercial 1 External Relations 1 Finance 1 Global Engagement 1 Governance 1 Human Resources 1 IT 1 Library 1 Marketing & Communications 1 Research (Admin. Support) 1 Student Recruitment and Admissions 1 Student Services 1 Teaching Support 1 Locations Campus Alfred campus 1 Caulfield campus 1 Clayton campus 1 Gippsland campus 1 Melbourne City campus 1 Parkville campus 1 Peninsula campus 1 Work type Continuing (Full-time) 1 Continuing (Part-time) 1 Fixed-term (Full-time) 1 Fixed-term (Part-time) 1 Faculty / Portfolio Vice-Chancellor and President 1 Level / Salary New Search Indigenous Pool for Professional Appointments - Expression of Interest Indigenous Careers - Expression of Interest - Professional Appointments At Monash University, we are committed to advancing the education and research aspirations of Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people. We aim to recruit, support and retain Indigenous staff to support this commitment. Monash has campuses at Clayton, Caulfield, Peninsula and Parkville. Roles at the University are extremely diverse, from customer service and administration to program management and academic and research roles. Support for Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander applicants include: Advice on preparing your application; Indigenous representation on your interview panel; Support in transitioning to your new role at Monash; Ongoing support from the William Cooper Institute; and Access to the Indigenous Employee Network. To be considered for employment at Monash under our Indigenous Employment Policy , please complete this Expression of Interest form. You will be automatically placed on our mailing list to receive job notifications. Our Program Manager (Employment and Engagement) will be in touch to discuss the process and opportunities. Eligibility - To be eligible for employment under our Indigenous Employment Policy, you must be able to provide proof of Aboriginality. This may be in the form of: a letter stamped with the common seal and signed by the chairperson of an Aboriginal and/or Torres Strait Islander Land Council; a letter stamped with the common seal and signed by a delegate of an incorporated Aboriginal and/or Torres Strait Islander organisation; a copy of your birth certificate and a copy of your parent/s confirmation of Aboriginality as described above; or If you would like to discuss your interest further, you can contact the Indigenous Employment Team at indigenous-employment@monash.edu. Please click on the “Apply” button below to start your application. Supporting a diverse workforce Back to search results Email Job Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Level / Salary Closes Indigenous Pool for Professional Appointments - Expression of Interest Alfred campus, Caulfield campus, Clayton campus, Gippsland campus, Melbourne City campus, Parkville campus, Peninsula campus Fantastic opportunity for Indigenous Australians to start their promising career at Monash University Current opportunities Position Location Level / Salary Closes Indigenous Pool for Professional Appointments - Expression of Interest Alfred campus, Caulfield campus, Clayton campus, Gippsland campus, Melbourne City campus, Parkville campus, Peninsula campus Fantastic opportunity for Indigenous Australians to start their promising career at Monash University Powered by PageUp We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Registered Australian University ABN: 12 377 614 012 TEQSA Provider ID: PRV12140 CRICOS Provider Number Monash University: 00008C Monash College: 01857J Authorised by Executive Director, Marketing Website feedback Last updated: Nov 2022 Accessibility Disclaimer & copyright Terms & conditions Data privacy & cyber security Data Consent Settings Copyright © 2026 Monash University We use cookies to improve your experience, but you can choose which ones we use, and opt-out at any time. You can find more information in our Website Terms and Conditions Accept  all Cookie settings"
