    "https://careers.pageuppeople.com/513/cw/en/job/697614/research-nurse": {
      "title": "Job Search",
      "description": "Job Search - Jobs at Monash Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Benefits Healthy Workplace Healthy Workplace Campus life Campus life Job search at Monash Job search at Monash How to apply How to apply How to apply International applicants International applicants Career reflection Career reflection Searching for a job Searching for a job Applying for a job Applying for a job What to expect What to expect Preparing for an interview Preparing for an interview FAQs FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Policies & Procedures Contact Us Contact Us Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Jobs at Monash Why work at Monash Benefits Healthy Workplace Campus life Job search at Monash How to apply International applicants Career reflection Searching for a job Applying for a job What to expect Preparing for an interview FAQs Trans and Gender Diverse Applicants Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us More Inclusive workplace Policies & Procedures Contact Us Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search You are here: Home | Job Search Job Search Applicant login Job alert Job Search e.g. Lecturer, Admin assistant Refine Search Categories Professional Research (Admin. Support) 1 Locations Monash Teaching Hospitals Box Hill Hospital 1 Work type Fixed-term (Full-time) 1 Faculty / Portfolio Faculty of Medicine Nursing and Health Sciences 1 Level / Salary HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 1 New Search Research Nurse (Haematology) Job No: 697614 Location: Box Hill Hospital Employment Type: Full-time Duration: 12-month fixed-term appointment Remuneration: $110,527 - $121,227 pa HEW Level 07 (plus 17% employer superannuation) Join a collaborative team of Research Nurses Build on your clinical research experience Take your career in exciting, rewarding directions The Opportunity The Eastern Health Clinical School is inviting you to join us as a Research Nurse to coordinate clinical trials, ensuring top-quality data and optimal participant care. Your role includes recruitment management, nursing care, participant education and meticulous data recording, all in line with professional standards. This position will be working with Haematology patients. Your demonstrated clinical skills, including problem-solving, planning and coordination of direct patient care will be instrumental in providing participants with comprehensive ongoing education about trial procedures. Additionally, you will be responsible for data collection, analysis and preparation of results, ensuring accuracy and adherence to protocol guidelines. Your proactive approach to monitoring participants' progress and facilitating further clinical management as needed will be crucial in driving the success of our research endeavours. To excel in this role, candidates must hold current registration as a Registered Nurse with the Nursing and Midwifery Board of Australia and have prior nursing experience. While not essential, experience in haematology will also be highly regarded. If you're passionate about clinical research and dedicated to making a meaningful impact in patient care, we invite you to apply now. Monash University seeks applicants for this opportunity who are able to demonstrate present valid and current Australian work rights. About Monash University At Monash , work feels different. There’s a sense of belonging, from contributing to something ground-breaking – a place where great things happen. We value difference and diversity , and welcome and celebrate everyone's contributions, lived experience and expertise. That’s why we champion an inclusive and respectful workplace culture where everyone is supported to succeed. Learn more about Monash . Join the pursuit of our purpose to build a better future for ourselves and our communities – #ChangeIt with us. Monash supports flexible and hybrid working arrangements. We have a range of policies in place enabling staff to combine work and personal commitments. This includes supporting parents . To Apply For instructions on how to apply, please refer to ' How to apply for Monash Jobs '. Please ensure your cover letter highlights your key offerings to this position. Diversity is one of our greatest strengths at Monash. We encourage applications from Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people, culturally and linguistically diverse people, people with disabilities, neurodivergent people, and people of all genders, sexualities, and age groups. Your employment is contingent upon the satisfactory completion of all pre-employment and/or background checks required for the role, as determined by the University. Enquiries: Liz Arnold, Clinical Trials Team Leader, 0437 830 326 Position Description: Research Nurse Application Close: Thursday, 10th September at 11:55pm Supporting a diverse workforce Back to search results Email Job Apply now Monash University recognises that its Australian campuses are located on the unceded lands of the people of the Kulin nations, and pays its respects to their elders, past and present. Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Level / Salary Closes Research Nurse Box Hill Hospital HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 10 Sep 2026 Join a collaborative team of Research Nurses at the Eastern Health Clinical School. Current opportunities Position Location Level / Salary Closes Research Nurse Box Hill Hospital HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 10 Sep 2026 Join a collaborative team of Research Nurses at the Eastern Health Clinical School. Powered by PageUp We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Registered Australian University ABN: 12 377 614 012 TEQSA Provider ID: PRV12140 CRICOS Provider Number Monash University: 00008C Monash College: 01857J Authorised by Executive Director, Marketing Website feedback Last updated: Nov 2022 Accessibility Disclaimer & copyright Terms & conditions Data privacy & cyber security Data Consent Settings Copyright © 2026