 jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Level / Salary Closes Senior HR Business Partner Clayton campus, Mulgrave HEW 9 ($145,062 - $153,976) 9 Sep 2026 Join our dynamic Business Partnering team, where you will collaborate in a portfolio-based approach to deliver comprehensive HR services and advice, both operationally and strategically. Research Assistant - Drug Discovery Parkville campus Level A ($86,195 - $116,981) 9 Sep 2026 In this role, you will contribute directly to vital research efforts focused on the discovery of novel drug targets and the development of antimalarial and antibacterial compounds. Research Nurse Box Hill Hospital HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 10 Sep 2026 Join a collaborative team of Research Nurses at the Eastern Health Clinical School. PhD Scholarships - ARC Research Hub for Critical Energy Separation Materials Clayton campus, New South Wales, Western Australia 30 Sep 2026 A PhD with the CREST Research Hub is an opportunity to undertake world-class research that will help transform Australia's critical minerals industry. Our PhD candidates are supervised by leading academics and mentored by industry experts, working on research that addresses real-world challenges and delivers meaningful impact. As a CREST PhD scholar, you will be part of a collaborative, multidisciplinary research environment with access to state-of-the-art facilities and strong industry engagement. Research Fellow (Identified) Clayton campus Level B ($123,138 - $146,228) 30 Sep 2026 Lead Indigenous research advancing culturally safe, intersectional outcomes for Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander academics. Project Officer, RSV Monitoring and Evaluation Project Monash Medical Centre HEW 6 ($100,155 - $108,106) 21 Sep 2026 Support the delivery of a Commonwealth Government RSV tender through project coordination, stakeholder engagement, reporting and process improvement. Research Fellow, Maternal and Infant RSV Protection Monash Medical Centre Level A ($86,195 - $116,981) 8 Sep 2026 Join as a Research Fellow and contribute to national RSV monitoring and evaluation. Disability Adviser Clayton campus HEW 6 ($100,155 - $108,106) 8 Sep 2026 The Disability Adviser is a key member of Monash University’s Disability Support Services team, providing high-level expertise and support to enhance access, inclusion and student success. Executive Director, Global Resilience Clayton campus 18 Sep 2026 We are in search of an experienced senior executive to establish and lead Monash's global and resilience function. Senior Campus Experience and Major Events Coordinator Clayton campus HEW 7 ($110,527 - $121,227) 6 Sep 2026 Coordinate major events and campus programs that enrich student engagement, working with partners and leading casual staff to deliver standout experiences. Research Fellow  - Chemical & Biological Engineering Clayton campus Level A ($86,195 - $116,981) 8 Sep 2026 Drive innovation at the intersection of non-Newtonian fluid mechanics, rheology, and advanced mineral processing with our world-class team in the Department of Chemical and Biological Engineering Research Officer - Bioinformatics Clayton campus HEW 6 ($100,155 - $108,106) 14 Sep 2026 Join the Kwan Lab at Monash Biomedicine Discovery Institute and Eastern Health Clinical School and contribute to innovative translational prostate cancer research. Manager, Safer Community Unit Clayton campus HEW 9 ($145,062 - $153,976) 6 Sep 2026 Lead a specialist team supporting the safety and wellbeing of Monash staff and students impacted by complex and high-risk problem behaviour and mental health concerns Senior Lecturer (Education Focused) Clayton campus Level C ($150,841 - $173,931) 6 Sep 2026 Monash Learning and Teaching has an exciting opportunity to join the team as a Senior Lecturer (Education Focused). Assistant Lecturer/Demonstrator - Anatomy & Developmental Biology - opportunities at Monash University Clayton campus Level A ($86,195 - $116,981) This is a unique opportunity to join a passionate team at a leading university in a top-ranked school of Biomedical Sciences. PhD scholarship opportunity in Materials Science and Engineering: NOₓ production by plasma bubble reactor Clayton campus The current project is titled “NOₓ production by plasma bubble reactor”. This project explores a plasma bubble reactor, where tiny plasma‑filled bubbles are injected into water to create nitrogen oxides (NOₓ) directly from the air. Because the bubbles are so small, they provide a large contact area, making the process highly efficient at room temperature and without any fossil fuels. Senior Research Fellow / Associate Professor (Research) & EMBL Australia Group Leader Clayton campus Level D ($181,629 - $200,092) 2 Oct 2026 The Australian Regenerative Medicine Institute (ARMI) at Monash University is seeking an exceptional, forward-thinking Senior Research Fellow / Associate Professor (Research) to join us as an EMBL Australia Group Leader. Domestic PhD Stipend Scholarship Opportunity - BloodCare Centre of Research Excellence (CRE) - Improving supportive care for patients with blood cancer St Kilda Road 25 Sep 2026 The NHMRC-funded BloodCare CRE is offering an outstanding PhD scholarship opportunity in supportive care for patients with blood cancers. Postdoctoral Research Fellow, Economics Caulfield campus Level B ($123,138 - $146,228) 16 Sep 2026 Contribute to research on digital e-auctions and agricultural markets through fieldwork, data analysis and collaboration across Lao PDR and Cambodia. PhD Scholarship Opportunity - Informing the Future of Work Disability Policy in Australia Using Community Preference Methods St Kilda Road 20 Sep 2