    "https://www.monash.edu/careers": {
      "title": "Home",
      "description": "Home - Careers Home Courses Monash Online Library Donate Previous menu Toggle navigation Careers Employing international students and graduates Employing international students and graduates Digital qualifications and credentials Digital qualifications and credentials Apply to study Skip to content Skip to navigation Home Home icon Monash Australia Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Monash Australia Monash India Monash Indonesia Monash Malaysia Monash Prato Monash Suzhou Monash Boston Hub Courses Monash Online Library Donate Staff Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Staff Staff portal Intranet M-Space The Insider Students Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Students Student portal Student website Monash Connect Monash Online hub Alumni Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Alumni Alumni portal Alumni website Search Menu Careers Employing international students and graduates Digital qualifications and credentials More Digital qualifications and credentials Apply to study Toggle Search Close Close\n                        Search Search Search courses https://www.monash.edu/search Search courses FAQs all things Monash See all other results Home For employers and community Monash University is Australia’s largest and one of its most globally recognised universities. Our 85,000 students represent the next generation of bold thinkers and future leaders. Engaging with Monash gives your organisation direct access to this talent. We can connect you with students who  are ready to bring fresh ideas, global perspectives and industry‑relevant skills to your workplace. Have a job or opportunity for our students? If you’ve got a graduate program, summer internship, job, leadership opportunity, award, or scholarship you’d like our students to know about, send us the details and we’ll review it for inclusion on our Jobs and Opportunities for students board. Host a student intern Help shape the next generation of talent by hosting a Monash student as an intern for an industry experience unit at your organisation. Complete an expression of interest today. Join a career event By attending one of our signature events, your organisation will get to connect with emerging professionals who are eager to engage with industry leaders. Students tend to go to one or two of these events, so you’ll meet a fresh mix of candidates each time you visit campus. Employing international students and graduates Digital qualifications and credentials Courses at Monash Are you a Monash student looking for industry experience? Explore internships, placements and collaborative project opportunities on our industry experience site. Employing bright Monash minds Facts and figures Graduate programs Structured programs for a set duration where the graduate rotates through different departments of the organisation. Internship and placements Course-related vacation work during semester breaks or placements during semester. Entry-level roles Positions for new graduates entering the workforce. Part-time, casual work Our students are flexible and available during the day and evenings, depending on their timetables. Connect with us Follow us on LinkedIn for the latest updates, student stories and career insights. We acknowledge and pay respects to the Elders and Traditional Owners of the land on which our Australian campuses stand. Information for Indigenous Australians Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources Important dates How to apply A-Z index Policy Bank FAQs Contact Contact us Campus maps Jobs at Monash Recruit a student Pay online News Latest news Monash Lens Podcasts A Different Lens Monash Life On Our Site Who we are Find a course Find a researcher Partner with Monash Sitemap Community Faculties Locations Diversity and inclusion Safety and security Sustainability Resources